  Title: The Whispering Mirror
  Subtitle: "CHAPTER EVENT \u2022 FEAR"
  StoryText: An antique standing mirror gleams amidst the mist. Your reflection smiles
    back a beat too slowly, extending a glittering card through the glass.
  Illustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a56b6f34f4ef2f747819d599af1379d1, type: 3}
  Choices:
  - Label: Accept the Reflection's Gift
    OutcomePreview: "[Gain Random Card \u2022 -15 Will]"
    ResultStory: Cold glass ripples against your fingertips as a powerful technique
      etches itself into your deck.
    RequiredMinGold: 0
    RequiredMinHealth: 0
    GoldDelta: 0
    HealthDelta: 0
    MaxHealthDelta: 0
    StressDelta: 15
    GrantRandomRelic: 0
    GrantRandomCard: 1
  - Label: Shatter the Illusion
    OutcomePreview: "[+5 Max HP \u2022 Lose 5 HP]"
    ResultStory: The mirror bursts into harmless silver dust. Your resolve hardens
      permanently.
    RequiredMinGold: 0
    RequiredMinHealth: 5
    GoldDelta: 0
    HealthDelta: -5
    MaxHealthDelta: 5
    StressDelta: 0
    GrantRandomRelic: 0
    GrantRandomCard: 0
  - Label: Walk Away Calmly
    OutcomePreview: '[Restore +15 Will]'
    ResultStory: You turn from the glass. The whispers fade into silence behind you.
    RequiredMinGold: 0
    RequiredMinHealth: 0
    GoldDelta: 0
    HealthDelta: 0
    MaxHealthDelta: 0
    StressDelta: -15
    GrantRandomRelic: 0
    GrantRandomCard: 0
